[113.147, "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u2590\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u259b\u2588\u2588\u2588\u259b\u2588\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[1mClaude Code\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mv2.1.318\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\u259d\u259c\u001b[48;2;0;0;0m\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u001b[49m\u2588\u2580\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102mOpus 5.5 with high effort \u00b7 Claude API\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u259d\u259d   \u259d\u259d \u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;102;102;102m~/pvc/mj\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m\u276f \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mRead RULES.md and INTERFACE.md. Implement MJ from the supplied pinned reference (reference/run.c) using only Mojo \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m1.2.0 and its standard library, built with \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mmojo build\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m. SIMD and compile-time parameters allowed. No Python interop, \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mno MAX, no external math library, no \u001b[38;2;87;105;247mparallelize\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m. Documentation and library source for this exact version are in \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m/Users/Shared/pvc-kit/mojo/docs\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m. Preserve the declared model, tokenizer, work, precision a"]
